---
import Layout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Now" description="What I'm doing now.">
  <article class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-24">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl font-bold mb-8 text-text-primary-light dark:text-text-primary">What I'm Doing Now</h1>
    <p class="font-mono text-text-secondary-light dark:text-text-secondary mb-8">Last updated: March 14, 2026</p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 text-text-primary-light dark:text-text-primary">Scrolling</h2>
<p class="font-mono text-text-secondary-light dark:text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Currently trying to break the habit of mindlessly scrolling, even just picking up my phone. Me updating my blog is apart of this breaking.</p>

<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 text-text-primary-light dark:text-text-primary">Moving My Body</h2>
<p class="font-mono text-text-secondary-light dark:text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">I find my job is quite active as it is so by the end of the day I do feel as if I need to just rest. I've been sick for essentially two months off and on so I've been taking it easy. I just recently started going back to the gym, and my body feels great! The hardest part is getting back into it and sticking to it. One of my goals this year is making weightlifting a habit. Another fitness goal is to get <em>bouncy</em> again. I don't jump much and I feel as though my body could really use that type of movement.</p>

<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 text-text-primary-light dark:text-text-primary">Reading/Watching/Playing</h2>
<p class="font-mono text-text-secondary-light dark:text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
  <span class="font-bold">Reading:</span> The Age of Reason by Jean-Paul Sartre<br>
  <span class="font-bold">Watching:</span> Bridgerton, The L Word<br>
  <span class="font-bold">Playing:</span> Minecraft: All day, everyday
</p>

<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 text-text-primary-light dark:text-text-primary">In terms of my life</h2>
<p class="font-mono text-text-secondary-light dark:text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">I feel a bit directionless right now. I want to find something that will fulfil me in a spiritual and corporal sense, but I'm struggling to find what that thing is. The fact that I'm investing a lot and have a good cushion for moving (again!) takes a weight off of my shoulders, though.</p>

    <hr class="my-12 border-surface" />
    <p>
      Want to chat? <a href={import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CALENDAR_URL || 'https://cal.com/jolyssa-armstrong-qmqhat/30min'} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">Grab 30 minutes →</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
